SEQUENCE:0
DESCRIPTION:Unpack a stunning tale of family\, secrets\, and resilience th
 is month with us. For our July gathering\, the Rockdale Readers Adult Book
  Club is diving into the lush\, multigenerational world of Banyan Moon by 
 Thao Thai. Spanning from Vietnam to a grand\, decaying manor in Florida\, 
 this beautifully written novel explores the complex bonds between mothers\
 , daughters\, and the ghosts of the past. Whether you’re a lifelong book
  club member or looking to join your very first discussion...
