DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260731T214500
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-791@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Shakespeare's forest comedy of runaway lovers\, amateur actors
 \, and fairies with a misapplied love potion.\n\nShakespeare's comedy of o
 ne moonlit night in the woods outside Athens. Four runaway lovers\, a band
  of amateur actors\, and a feuding fairy king and queen cross paths\, and 
 a mischievous sprite's love potion lands on the wrong eyelids. Before morn
 ing\, affections have swapped and the weaver Bottom is wearing a donkey's 
 head. From the Atlanta Shakespeare Company\, performed with food and drink
  served at the table in its Elizabethan-style playhouse.
GEO:33.768171;-84.3851523
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154233Z
LOCATION:Shakespeare Tavern Playhouse\, 499 Peachtree St NE
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.shakespearetavern.com/on-stage/company/a-midsummer-nights-
 dream
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Great American Trailer Park Musical
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260731T193000
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-1415@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Musicals
DESCRIPTION:Nehls and Kelso's trashy\, big-hearted comedy of adultery\, ag
 oraphobia\, and hurricanes at a Florida trailer park.\n\nDavid Nehls and B
 etsy Kelso's musical comedy\, an Off-Broadway hit in 2005\, set at Armadil
 lo Acres trailer park in Starke\, Florida. Jeannie hasn't stepped outside 
 her trailer in twenty years\; her tollbooth-collector husband Norbert is l
 osing patience\; and Pippi\, a stripper hiding out from a marker-huffing e
 x with a gun named Bertha\, has just moved in next door. The affair that f
 ollows kicks up a storm in more ways than one. From New Depot Players\, th
 e Conyers community theatre.
GEO:33.6671075;-84.0180229
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154223Z
