DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260906T130000
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-1327@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Musicals
DESCRIPTION:Lin-Manuel Miranda's hip-hop biography of Alexander Hamilton\,
  on national tour.\n\nLin-Manuel Miranda's musical about Alexander Hamilto
 n\, the orphaned immigrant who wrote his way into the American Revolution 
 and the founding of the nation. The score moves through hip-hop\, R&B\, an
 d jazz\, drawing on Ron Chernow's biography for its history. Winner of 11 
 Tony Awards and the Pulitzer Prize for Drama\, with direction by Thomas Ka
 il and choreography by Andy Blankenbuehler. A national touring production.
GEO:33.7726136;-84.3853395
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154214Z
LOCATION:Fox Theatre\, 660 Peachtree St NE
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://foxtheatre.evenue.net/cgi-bin/ncommerce3/SEGetGroupList?groupC
 ode=HAM&linkID=fta&shopperContext=&caller=&appCode=
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Purpose
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260906T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260906T161500
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-126@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Play
DESCRIPTION:Branden Jacobs-Jenkins' Tony- and Pulitzer-winning drama of a 
 Black political dynasty's reunion coming undone.\n\nThe Jaspers are a Chic
 ago dynasty of ministers\, activists\, and changemakers\, gathering for a 
 long-overdue family reunion. When a young outsider arrives with questions 
 nobody wants asked\, the family's carefully guarded secrets start to surfa
 ce over one evening. Branden Jacobs-Jenkins (Appropriate\, An Octoroon) wo
 n both the 2025 Tony Award for Best Play and the Pulitzer Prize for Drama 
 for this one\; the New York Post called it "unstoppably fierce\, funny\, a
 nd ruthless." Keith Arthur Bolden directs for the Alliance Theatre\, in a 
 co-production with McCarter Theatre Center\; runs through September 20.
GEO:33.7893845;-84.3846553
LAST-MODIFIED:20260726T205057Z
LOCATION:Woodruff Arts Center\, 1280 Peachtree St NE
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://my.alliancetheatre.org/164228/164288
END:VEVENT
