BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cotton Patch Gospel: Season 50 Return Engagement
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261018T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261018T163000
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-968@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Musicals
DESCRIPTION:Matthew's Gospel retold in small-town Georgia with Harry Chapi
 n's bluegrass score\, back for Theatrical Outfit's 50th season.\n\nTom Key
  and Russell Treyz's musical transplants the Gospel of Matthew to rural Ge
 orgia\, where Jesus is born in Gainesville and the storytelling runs on ba
 njo and fiddle. The bluegrass score is by Harry Chapin\, his final work be
 fore his death in 1981\, and the show draws on Clarence Jordan's homespun 
 Cotton Patch translations of the New Testament. It returns as a special en
 gagement in Theatrical Outfit's 50th anniversary season\, with performance
 s through October 18.
GEO:33.757035;-84.389486
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154239Z
LOCATION:Theatrical Outfit\, 84 Luckie St NW
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ride the Cyclone
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261018T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261018T163000
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-1380@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Musicals
DESCRIPTION:Six choir kids die on a roller coaster and compete in song for
  one shot back at life.\n\nJacob Richmond and Brooke Maxwell's cult dark-c
 omedy musical: six teenagers from a small-town Canadian chamber choir peri
 sh on a faulty coaster and wake in limbo\, where a mechanical fortune tell
 er offers exactly one of them a return to life. Each teen pleads their cas
 e in song\, from autotuned gangsta rap to a torchy French lament. The show
  has local roots of a sort — its 2019 Alliance Theatre run supplied the 
 cast for the world premiere recording. A community production from the Hen
 ry Players.
GEO:33.4486439;-84.1418279
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154217Z
LOCATION:The Henry Players Theater\, 136 Hood St
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.simpletix.com/e/ride-the-cyclone-tickets-271694
END:VEVENT
