END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Vanya and Sonia and Masha and Spike
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T213000
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-1260@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Christopher Durang's Chekhov-riffing comedy: a movie-star sist
 er\, her young boyfriend\, and a family farmhouse up for sale.\n\nChristop
 her Durang's comedy borrows its names and its moods from Chekhov\, then le
 ts them loose in present-day Pennsylvania. Siblings Vanya and Sonia have s
 pent their quiet lives in the family farmhouse\; their movie-star sister M
 asha blows in for the weekend with her much younger boyfriend Spike and an
 nounces she's selling the place. Rivalry\, regret\, and a costume party fo
 llow. The play won the 2013 Tony Award for Best Play\; this production com
 es from Arcadia Theater.
GEO:34.0765277;-84.2884766
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154157Z
LOCATION:Arcadia Theater\, 180 Academy St
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.simpletix.com/e/vanya-sasha-masha-spike-tickets-279857
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ride the Cyclone
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T213000
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-1381@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Musicals
DESCRIPTION:Six choir kids die on a roller coaster and compete in song for
  one shot back at life.\n\nJacob Richmond and Brooke Maxwell's cult dark-c
 omedy musical: six teenagers from a small-town Canadian chamber choir peri
 sh on a faulty coaster and wake in limbo\, where a mechanical fortune tell
 er offers exactly one of them a return to life. Each teen pleads their cas
 e in song\, from autotuned gangsta rap to a torchy French lament. The show
  has local roots of a sort — its 2019 Alliance Theatre run supplied the 
 cast for the world premiere recording. A community production from the Hen
 ry Players.
GEO:33.4486439;-84.1418279
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154217Z
LOCATION:The Henry Players Theater\, 136 Hood St
STATUS:CONFIRMED
