DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-4356@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Guided Tours
DESCRIPTION:An after-dark guided ghost walk through a historic cemetery\, 
 from Aurora Theatre's Lawrenceville Ghost Tours.\n\nA guided nighttime wal
 k through a historic cemetery in the oldest city in metro Atlanta — a to
 wn where\, the story goes\, turn-of-the-century downtown renovations woke 
 the sleeping ghosts and set off a wave of paranormal reports. Part of the 
 Lawrenceville Ghost Tours\, the haunted-attraction side of Aurora Theatre.
GEO:33.9568797;-83.9880958
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T044316Z
LOCATION:Lawrenceville Arts Center\, 125 N Clayton St
