SUMMARY:Vanya and Sonia and Masha and Spike
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T213000
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-1267@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Christopher Durang's Chekhov-riffing comedy: a movie-star sist
 er\, her young boyfriend\, and a family farmhouse up for sale.\n\nChristop
 her Durang's comedy borrows its names and its moods from Chekhov\, then le
 ts them loose in present-day Pennsylvania. Siblings Vanya and Sonia have s
 pent their quiet lives in the family farmhouse\; their movie-star sister M
 asha blows in for the weekend with her much younger boyfriend Spike and an
 nounces she's selling the place. Rivalry\, regret\, and a costume party fo
 llow. The play won the 2013 Tony Award for Best Play\; this production com
 es from Arcadia Theater.
GEO:34.0765277;-84.2884766
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154157Z
LOCATION:Arcadia Theater\, 180 Academy St
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.simpletix.com/e/vanya-sasha-masha-spike-tickets-279857
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Othello
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T193000
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-1480@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Shakespeare's tragedy of jealousy — Iago whispers\, and a gr
 eat general's faith in his wife unravels.\n\nShakespeare's tragedy of a Ve
 netian general undone not by war but by his own ensign: Iago\, passed over
  for promotion\, sets out to convince Othello that his new wife Desdemona 
 has been unfaithful\, using little more than insinuation and a misplaced h
 andkerchief. Iago is one of the longest roles in the canon\, and watching 
 him work the room is half the horror. From the Atlanta Shakespeare Company
 \, performed Elizabethan-style with food and drink served at your table.
GEO:33.768171;-84.3851523
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154234Z
LOCATION:Shakespeare Tavern Playhouse\, 499 Peachtree St NE
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.shakespearetavern.com/on-stage/company/othello
END:VEVENT
