SUMMARY:A Christmas Carol
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261127T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261127T211500
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-204@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Play
DESCRIPTION:Dickens's Scrooge-and-three-ghosts classic in David H. Bell's 
 adaptation with live music\, from the Alliance Theatre.\n\nCharles Dickens
 's 1843 tale of Ebenezer Scrooge\, the miser visited by the ghosts of Chri
 stmas Past\, Present\, and Yet to Come on a single night of reckoning. The
  Alliance Theatre's annual production uses David H. Bell's adaptation\, st
 aged with live music and a large company of characters. Amanda Watkins dir
 ects\, building on Leora Morris's original staging. Runs through December 
 27.
GEO:33.7893845;-84.3846553
LAST-MODIFIED:20260726T205057Z
LOCATION:Woodruff Arts Center\, 1280 Peachtree St NE
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://my.alliancetheatre.org/164230/164916
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Othello
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261127T193000
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-1491@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Shakespeare's tragedy of jealousy — Iago whispers\, and a gr
 eat general's faith in his wife unravels.\n\nShakespeare's tragedy of a Ve
 netian general undone not by war but by his own ensign: Iago\, passed over
  for promotion\, sets out to convince Othello that his new wife Desdemona 
 has been unfaithful\, using little more than insinuation and a misplaced h
 andkerchief. Iago is one of the longest roles in the canon\, and watching 
 him work the room is half the horror. From the Atlanta Shakespeare Company
 \, performed Elizabethan-style with food and drink served at your table.
GEO:33.768171;-84.3851523
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154234Z
LOCATION:Shakespeare Tavern Playhouse\, 499 Peachtree St NE
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.shakespearetavern.com/on-stage/company/othello
END:VEVENT
