BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Carmen
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270205T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270205T224200
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-395@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Musicals
DESCRIPTION:Bizet's tragedy of obsession: a soldier\, a bullfighter\, and 
 the woman who refuses to be owned.\n\nGeorges Bizet's 1875 opera\, set in 
 Seville: Carmen\, a factory worker who answers to no one\, throws a flower
  at the one soldier ignoring her. Don José picks it up and unravels — d
 eserting the army\, abandoning his sweetheart\, and following Carmen into 
 the mountains\, only to lose her to the bullfighter Escamillo. The score h
 olds some of opera's most familiar melodies\, the Habanera and the Toreado
 r Song among them\, though its first Paris audiences were scandalized by s
 o much lawlessness on the Opéra-Comique stage. From The Atlanta Opera.
GEO:33.88471;-84.4585962
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154158Z
LOCATION:Cobb Energy Performing Arts Centre\, 2800 Cobb Galleria Pkwy
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://tickets.atlantaopera.org/145907/145976
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sweat
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270205T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270205T213000
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-1390@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Lynn Nottage's Pulitzer-winning drama of factory friends in a 
 Rust Belt bar as the layoffs begin.\n\nLynn Nottage's 2015 drama\, winner 
 of the 2017 Pulitzer Prize\, set mostly in a bar in Reading\, Pennsylvania
 \, where a circle of steel-plant workers has gathered for years. When one 
 of the friends is promoted to management and jobs start moving to Mexico\,
  the lines between labor and boss\, and along race\, begin to cut through 
 the group. Nottage built the play from years of interviews with residents 
 of Reading\, then one of the poorest cities in America. From the Henry Pla
 yers.
GEO:33.4486439;-84.1418279
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154217Z
LOCATION:The Henry Players Theater\, 136 Hood St
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.simpletix.com/e/sweat-tickets-271676
END:VEVENT
