BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Proof
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270207T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270207T170000
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-1625@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:David Auburn's Pulitzer-winning drama: a mathematician's daugh
 ter\, a mysterious proof\, and the question of who wrote it.\n\nDavid Aubu
 rn's drama won the 2001 Pulitzer Prize and the Tony for Best Play. Catheri
 ne spent years caring for her father\, a brilliant University of Chicago m
 athematician whose mind unraveled before his death. Now one of his former 
 students is combing through the hundred-odd notebooks he left behind\, and
  a groundbreaking proof about prime numbers surfaces. The question of who 
 wrote it forces Catherine to reckon with how much of her father\, genius a
 nd instability alike\, she may have inherited. From Stage Door Theatre.
GEO:33.9447222;-84.3319444
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154234Z
LOCATION:Stage Door Theatre\, 5339 Chamblee Dunwoody Rd
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://ci.ovationtix.com/36385/performance/11825814/selecttickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Carmen
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270207T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270207T181200
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-396@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Musicals
DESCRIPTION:Bizet's tragedy of obsession: a soldier\, a bullfighter\, and 
 the woman who refuses to be owned.\n\nGeorges Bizet's 1875 opera\, set in 
 Seville: Carmen\, a factory worker who answers to no one\, throws a flower
  at the one soldier ignoring her. Don José picks it up and unravels — d
 eserting the army\, abandoning his sweetheart\, and following Carmen into 
 the mountains\, only to lose her to the bullfighter Escamillo. The score h
 olds some of opera's most familiar melodies\, the Habanera and the Toreado
 r Song among them\, though its first Paris audiences were scandalized by s
 o much lawlessness on the Opéra-Comique stage. From The Atlanta Opera.
GEO:33.88471;-84.4585962
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154158Z
LOCATION:Cobb Energy Performing Arts Centre\, 2800 Cobb Galleria Pkwy
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://tickets.atlantaopera.org/145907/145977
END:VEVENT
