SUMMARY:LETTERKENNY LIVE
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270216T193000
DTSTAMP:20260729T154349Z
UID:occ-1736@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy
DESCRIPTION:The Letterkenny cast live: all-new sketches from Wayne\, Squir
 rely Dan\, and the rest of the hicks\, skids\, and hockey players.\n\nA na
 tional touring live show from the cast of Letterkenny\, Jared Keeso's Cana
 dian sitcom about the hicks\, skids\, and hockey players of a small rural 
 Ontario town\, famous for its rapid-fire small-town vernacular. Keeso appe
 ars as Wayne alongside original castmates including Nathan Dales and K. Tr
 evor Wilson\, performing sketch material written for the tour rather than 
 recycled from the show. The series ran twelve seasons on Crave\; Rolling S
 tone called it "marvelously goofy."
GEO:33.7726136;-84.3853395
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T154214Z
LOCATION:Fox Theatre\, 660 Peachtree St NE
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://foxtheatre.evenue.net/events/LET
END:VEVENT
