UID:occ-1596@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy
DESCRIPTION:Improv comedy from the Southside Sidekicks\, the in-house trou
 pe of Southside Theatre Guild.\n\nComedy made up on the spot: scenes and c
 haracters built live from audience suggestions\, so no two shows are the s
 ame. Performed by the Southside Sidekicks\, the in-house improv troupe of 
 Southside Theatre Guild\, an all-volunteer community theatre running since
  1973.
